53
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:15,340
Would a believer in God ever
read such a scandalous scripture?

54
00:03:15,700 --> 00:03:16,917
Sergius, who are you?

55
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,617
How did you get in this place?

56
00:03:18,700 --> 00:03:19,877
Except for on Sundays,

57
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:24,254
