members of the general public to enter.

58
00:03:25,020 --> 00:03:29,079
I am aware of the restrictions, but
I am deathly allergic to the sun.

59
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:32,820
If I am not mistaken, the
sun sets at 6.19 today.

60
00:03:33,340 --> 00:03:37,516
Until that time comes, I cannot go
home, which is why I rested in here.

61
00:03:40,140 --> 00:03:40,970
I see.

62
00:03:41,420 --> 00:03:44,797
Well, in that case, is there
anything I can do to help you?

63
00:03:44,880 --> 00:03:45,900
Not at all.

64
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:48,310
Okay.

65
00:03:48,393 --> 00:03:49,223
That's unfortunate.

66
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:51,670
it.

67
00:03:51,753 --> 00:03:53,477
I won't tell the head priest
about encountering you,

68
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:55,854
but you must be gone when the sun sets.

69
00:03:59,100 --> 00:03:59,930
My, my.

70
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:01,689
You're an interesting one.

71
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:04,190
How so?

72
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:06,257
You're not going to throw me out.

73
00:04:06,340 --> 00:04:10,046
What if I were a burglar who came
here to rob this place of its

74
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:13,117
