the arrow and pray.

99
00:05:32,180 --> 00:05:35,298
No matter how many years
might have passed since now.

100
00:05:35,620 --> 00:05:36,450
Got it?

101
00:05:36,820 --> 00:05:39,440
All I ask is for you to keep that in mind.

102
00:05:40,980 --> 00:05:44,840
Once we reach sundown, it
shall be like I was never here.

103
00:05:54,840 --> 00:05:55,680
What's this?

104
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:57,640
My toes!

105
00:05:57,960 --> 00:05:59,431
The toes on my left foot!

106
00:06:00,180 --> 00:06:01,360
They're not twisted!

107
00:06:02,420 --> 00:06:03,250
Hey, wait!

108
00:06:03,420 --> 00:06:04,760
Who even are you?!

109
00:06:11,840 --> 00:06:12,960
please father

110
00:06:14,740 --> 00:06:16,080
listen to my plea

111
00:06:16,660 --> 00:06:19,520
I beg of you I have a confession to make

112
00:06:20,640 --> 00:06:24,580
yes well one moment I'll get the
priest I'm stricken with disease

113
00:06:25,340 --> 00:06:27,200
and I fear I'm going to die

114
00:06:28,740 --> 00:06:30,858
there's no cure that can help me now

115
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:35,340
but my illness isn't what
I'm here to confess about

116
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:38,880
my sin was to my family

117
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:43,268
Sixteen years ago, on
the night of June 5th,

118
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:48,306
