My grades have sort of tanked recently.

182
00:10:10,860 --> 00:10:13,389
I'll catch up eventually,
but what'll I do?

183
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:17,357
I have a boyfriend.

184
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:18,580
He's amazing.

185
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:22,220
I met him two weeks ago.

186
00:10:22,540 --> 00:10:23,737
I really like him.

187
00:10:23,820 --> 00:10:25,677
It's like our hearts are connected.

188
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:27,500
He's my soulmate.

189
00:10:29,260 --> 00:10:30,960
Good for you, Perla.

190
00:10:32,740 --> 00:10:33,840
Thanks, big bro.

191
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:37,377
Let's start with the conclusion.

192
00:10:37,460 --> 00:10:40,637
The soon-to-be priest Enrico
never once uttered a word to his

193
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:44,838
sister about her new boyfriend Weather
being his younger twin brother.

194
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:50,020
From here on out in the story,
I would like you, the viewer,

195
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:52,320
to be the judge in deciding who is

196
00:10:52,740 --> 00:10:54,657
the one who has committed a sin.

197
00:10:54,740 --> 00:10:58,505
Was it the mother who had sinned
for having switched the babies?

198
00:11:00,520 --> 00:11:01,797
The parents? Enrico?

199
00:11:01,880 --> 00:11:04,397
Or was it Weather who didn't know a thing?

200
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:07,077
He looked into who
Weather was to learn who

201
00:11:07,160 --> 00:11:09,517
