had fallen in love with.

202
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:14,760
After discovering the shocking truth In
Enrico's mind, there was only one solution.

203
00:11:15,920 --> 00:11:20,744
No matter what the sacrifice, I have to
stop Perla from getting hurt in any way!

204
00:11:23,300 --> 00:11:24,920
You look familiar, boy.

205
00:11:25,100 --> 00:11:27,657
Ain't you the rich kid
who goes to a seminary?

206
00:11:27,740 --> 00:11:30,034
Are you sure you want to be doing this?

207
00:11:30,180 --> 00:11:32,897
If everything goes well,
I will double your pay.

208
00:11:32,980 --> 00:11:35,437
There are only two
things I want you to do.

209
00:11:35,520 --> 00:11:37,402
First, do not ask any questions.

210
00:11:38,020 --> 00:11:40,138
And second, make these two break up.

211
00:11:41,220 --> 00:11:45,777
I bet if I make a couple of thugs threaten
Wes, he'll break things off with Perla.

212
00:11:45,860 --> 00:11:46,740
That is all.

213
00:11:47,060 --> 00:11:49,037
The only thing Perla
will suffer from is an

214
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:51,737
ordinary heartbreak that
anyone would experience.

215
00:11:51,820 --> 00:11:55,114
The scars that will be left
on her heart won't be fatal.

216
00:11:55,820 --> 00:11:56,650
However,

217
00:11:56,733 --> 00:11:59,217
what Enrico failed to
realize was the true nature

218
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:02,124
of this private detective
who he sought to hire.

219
00:12:02,340 --> 00:12:05,197
This man who has a proclivity
for prying into secrets.

220
00:12:05,280 --> 00:12:08,037
A man who holds a prejudice
deep within his heart.

221
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:10,237
One which stemmed from the inhumane laws

222
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:12,737
that dominated the South
just a century ago.

223
00:12:12,820 --> 00:12:15,291
A prejudice that is very much still alive.

224
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:20,160
Goddamn sumbitch.

225
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:25,080
After doing some research on that West
kid, I discovered that back in 1972,

226
00:12:25,520 --> 00:12:29,877
his whore mother married a black man,
all the while living in this very city.

227
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:33,560
So even though he looks white,
that boy is a black man's son.

228
00:12:35,640 --> 00:12:37,617
After this revelation, the P .I.

229
00:12:37,700 --> 00:12:39,229
rallied his clan together.

230
00:12:51,400 --> 00:12:53,857
Don't worry that pretty
little head, sweetheart.

231
00:12:53,940 --> 00:12:56,175
We're gonna be punishing him, not you.

232
00:12:56,320 --> 00:12:57,297
That's right, baby.

233
00:12:57,380 --> 00:12:59,217
Come here and give me
a kiss, why don't you?

234
00:12:59,300 --> 00:13:02,217
Plant one on this nice
upstanding sheriff now, you hear?

235
00:13:02,300 --> 00:13:05,297
You think you're all proper,
don't you little slut?

236
00:13:05,380 --> 00:13:08,917
Lucky for you, you're a white girl, so
it don't matter who you fool around with.

237
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:10,237
But not that shit, Stone!

238
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:15,261
An animal like him can't be allowed to taste
those sweet lips of yours for a second!

239
00:13:18,480 --> 00:13:21,537
Your older brother's the
one who asked me to do this.

240
00:13:21,620 --> 00:13:25,937
And just so your ass is well aware, we've
already paid a visit to your mama's house!

241
00:13:26,020 --> 00:13:29,460
So you know, your childhood
home is already up in flames!

242
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:46,400
In the end, who was the one truly
being punished in all of this?

243
00:13:46,760 --> 00:13:48,740
Was it Weather? Perla?

244
00:13:49,760 --> 00:13:54,525
Perhaps all anyone did up until this point
was love someone with all their heart.

245
00:13:55,320 --> 00:14:00,580
The only truth that can be found is that
love brought about the worst-case scenario.

246
00:14:02,300 --> 00:14:03,220
As for weather,

247
00:14:03,540 --> 00:14:08,260
he was hung from a tree overlooking the
cliffside, and was left there to rot.

248
00:14:08,880 --> 00:14:11,380
